# TESTS.LIST — the flight's fixture list (BOOTLIST, rmbp-ledger B817, R132). `./arroyo esp-x86` stages it at the ESP root;
# the kernel reads /boot/TESTS.LIST at the boot's first [desktop] built and runs it on one worker, one verb at a time.
# One verb per line (`tests` optional, one argument word kept), `#` comments, `@<s>` = the fixture's budget (default 60 s;
# an overrun prints `:: <VERB>: -> SKIP(budget <s>s) ::` and the list moves on). Lines under `HEAVY:` (and nameindextx /
# abimage anywhere) run after the light tier's summary — or on a boot after the first-user boot when /boot/TESTS.HEAVY
# says `boot2`. Edit this file (or the card's copy) to change the list; no rebuild.
# Flight 37's list (docs/dev/evidence/rmbp-0915/flight37/FLIGHT37.md §4, §7), in the order the bench typed it.
kgr
gatesteal2
unafslock
hidstall
fpu
clock
gen7
wifi
startscene
contrast
winkey
settingsmap
toastcap
uninstall
applaunch
shimmeridle
memline
glyphs
k2p
volkey
reask
uvccam
idlenet
nicabsent
xts
keyboot
a11ytree
# sleep — OUT until SLEEP2 lands: it suspends xHCI and cannot restore it (FLIGHT37 §5, the wire died); remove the `#` then.
trash
abielf
kelfhash
appfault
tzlocale
keymaps
smartline
notelemetry
focussteal
veilcost
aging
camdot
unplug
a11yfilters
zoom
perfhud
diskfull
autolock
undomove
mtpphone
fileversions
desktopcraft
starfield
softy
dragmouse
winresize
menuscraft
menubar
statustray
dockpins
notify
doorsplit
filetypes
stria
quarryhover
motion
stackroom
lockreg
pointerfeel
a2dp
HEAVY:
# The card-heavy fixtures (FLIGHT37 §4): NAMEINDEXTX held MOUNT+CARD 5 min, ABIMAGE copied 2 x 21.8 MB in 9 min.
nameindextx @600
abimage @900
# PIDESK-LIST (rmbp-ledger B889): the aarch64 desktop's probes, Pi and Orin only (`@<board>` = boot::OLDEST.0; rmbp12 counts them other=); HEAVY: their run time is unmeasured (B817's budget rule).
textscale @pi4 @orin
overlays @pi4 @orin
